{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e4c2a9-5d31-4f68-9a12-6f0c3d8e4a71",
    "name": "VERGEL API - Módulo Reportes",
    "description": "Colección para probar los 8 reportes de solo lectura: ventas, clientes, plantas, cobros, estado de cotizaciones, compras, rentabilidad y suscripciones.\n\nUso:\n1. Ejecutar 'Autenticación > Login' con admin@vergel.com / password123. El script guarda el token en la variable 'token'.\n2. Ajustar 'apiUrl' si la API no está en http://localhost:8000.\n3. Ajustar 'customerId', 'plantId', 'employeeId' y 'planId' con registros existentes.\n4. Opcional: llenar 'tokenConsulta' con el token de un rol no admin para probar el 403.\n\nTodos los endpoints están bajo /api/v1/reports, requieren Bearer token y están restringidos a Admin/Administrador activo. Los intentos denegados se registran en audit_log con affected_table=reports.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "apiUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "{{apiUrl}}/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenConsulta",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "plantId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "employeeId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "planId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Autenticación",
      "description": "Obtener el token de Sanctum. La ruta /api/login es pública; el resto requiere el token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (guarda token en la colección)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Token de acceso obtenido', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@vergel.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesión con el administrador sembrado y almacena el access_token para las siguientes peticiones."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesión del token actual (POST /api/logout). Ejecutar al final."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
